      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "יעבץ\/עצבי",
      "rationale": "Thapelo ya Yaabetse e bula ka leina la gagwe: o kgopela gore עצב (bothoko) e se ke ya mo fihlela — leina le thapelo di ralana."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "ברך תברכני",
      "rationale": "Infinitive absolute (go ntswarela ka ntswarelo) bo tlodiša go tiisa — 'ka kgonthe' — e sego thapelo ya go ka bja fela."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "ועשית מרעה",
      "rationale": "Sengwe le sengwe se se ka bja se re 'o dire ka mpe' (go bopa se se mpe) goba 'o ntirele mpe' — KJV 'keep me from evil' e ya go ya bobedi."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme Yaabetse a bitša Elohim wa Yisraele, a re: Ge e ba o ka ntswarela ka ntswarelo ya kgonthe, gomme wa oketša ⟨את⟩ mollwane wa ka! Gomme sephatla sa gago se be le nna, gomme o ntirele mpe, gore e se ke ya ntlhaba bothoko! Gomme Elohim a neela ⟨את⟩ seo a se kgopilego.",
